        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa, Aaroni, ni batabane b'Aaroni n'abaali ab'okusimba weema dhaibwe emberi ow'Eweema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda, ku luuyi lwayo olw'e buvandhuba. Omulimo gwaibwe gwali gwa kulabiriranga emikolo egikolebwa mu Kifo Ekitukuvu olw'Abaisiraeli. Era ng'omuntu owundi yeenayeena agezaaku okukola omulimo ogwo ali n'okwitibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obungi obw'Abalevi boonaboona, okuva ku baana ab'omwezi omulala okutuuka ku basaadha abakulu, baali emitwalo ebiri n'enkumi ibiri (22,000). Abo Musa ni Aaroni be baabala nga bajiira ku nda dhaibwe, nga Musengwa Katonda bweyalagira Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ati: “Bala abaana ab'Abaisiraeli abalenzi ababeri okuva ku w'omwezi omulala n'okweyongerayo, oghandiike amaina gaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oidha kundhawulira Abalevi babe bange, nze Musengwa Katonda, mu kifo eky'abaana abo abalenzi ababeri ab'Abaisiraeli. Era ondhawulire ensolo edh'Abalevi dhibe dhange, mu kifo ky'ensolo edhizaalibwa mu luzaalo olusooka edh'Abaisiraeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Musa yaabala abaana abalenzi ababeri ab'Abaisiraeli, nga Musengwa Katonda bweyamulagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era abaana abo ababeri okuva ku b'omwezi omulala okutuuka ku basaadha abakulu abaabalibwa, baali emitwalo ebiri n'enkumi ibiri na bibiri na nsanvu na basatu (22,273).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
